      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>Part I-A, Line 1 - Direct and Indirect Political Campaign Activities</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE DEPUTY DISTRICT ATTORNEYS ASSOCIATION OF SAN DIEGO COUNTY (THE "ASSOCIATION") IS A LABOR ASSOCIATION UNDER IRC SECTION 501(C)(5). DURING 2022, 2023 AND CY 2024, THE ASSOCIATION INCURRED NO DIRECT OR INDIRECT LOBBYING OR POLITICAL EXPENDITURES, NOR DID IT INCUR ANY VOLUNTEER HOURS. DURING 2020, 2022, 2023, AND CY 2024 THE ASSOCIATION ENDORSED CANDIDATES FOR LOCAL PUBLIC OFFICE WHO ARE COMMITTED TO PUBLIC SAFETY AND THE PUBLIC SERVANTS WHO SERVE AND PROTECT THE COUNTY AND CITY OF SAN DIEGO. THE ASSOCIATION'S ENDORSEMENTS CAN BE FOUND ON THE ASSOCIATION'S WEBSITE. (WWW.SDDDAA.NET)</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
    </IRS990ScheduleC>
