        <ExplanationTxt>THE ORGANIZATION IS A SECTION 501(C)(5) LABOR ASSOCIATION FOR ACTIVE MEMBER DEPUTY DISTRICT ATTORNEYS OF SAN DIEGO COUNTY.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>Form 990, Part VI, Section A, Line 7a</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE OFFICERS AND BOARD OF DIRECTORS ARE ELECTED TO TWO YEAR TERMS BY THE ASSOCIATION'S MEMBERS.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>Form 990, Part VI, Section A, Line 7b</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>ALL DECISIONS INVOLVING ACCEPTANCE OF CONTRACTS AND MOAS ARE SUBJECT TO APPROVAL BY THE ASSOCIATION'S MEMBERS.</ExplanationTxt>
